<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"916ea8724331b0a4\" href=\"?note=916ea8724331b0a4\" title=\"67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration\">67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §2，Theorem 13 与 Lemmas 7–8，印刷页 84–87；PDF 第 95–98 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"已核对 Theorem 13 陈述及两方向论证；阅读 Lemmas 7–8，未逐式重建独立 Henkin 构造"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致、原始递归公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不要求扩张 PA。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\varnothing}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\varnothing}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a> 对空公理公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_\\varnothing(z)\\equiv z\\ne z\">\\(\\sigma_\\varnothing(z)\\equiv z\\ne z\\)</span> 的实例，只表示纯一阶逻辑的内部可证性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{g(\\varphi)}\">\\(\\overline{g(\\varphi)}\\)</span> 为公式编码的数词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}\">\\(\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"31b7e1fe9d49615e\" href=\"?note=31b7e1fe9d49615e\" title=\"67-df-faithful-interpretability\">67-df-faithful-interpretability</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>；标准编码与证明算术化固定为下列本册参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Bigl[S\\unlhd T\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\varnothing}(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\n\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Bigl[S\\unlhd T\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\varnothing}(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\n\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>右侧谈的是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 对“逻辑可证”的内部断言，不能换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>，也不能换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 自身的可证性谓词。</p>\n<p>原书反向先用 Corollary 2 选择可证一致的表示，再用 Lemma 7 控制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 所证明的内部可证性只需有限源片段；Lemma 8 的独立 Henkin 构造给一个反映内部可证性的解释。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash t(\\varphi)\">\\(T\\vdash t(\\varphi)\\)</span>，便得到某有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq S\">\\(F\\subseteq S\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\varnothing}(\\ulcorner\\bigwedge F\\to\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\varnothing}(\\ulcorner\\bigwedge F\\to\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span>，再由右侧条件得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(S\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>正向用忠实解释、Fact 12 的内部逻辑保持以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的本质反身性。已读原书两方向证明；Lemma 8 使用第 2 章独立公式构造与算术化 Henkin 草图，本次没有把这些底层机制重建为完整机器证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 Cambridge/ASL 2016 重印本 PDF；第 6 章 §2，Theorem 13 与 Lemmas 7–8，印刷页 84–87；PDF 第 95–98 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对 Theorem 13 陈述及两方向论证；阅读 Lemmas 7–8，未逐式重建独立 Henkin 构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-faithful-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"31b7e1fe9d49615e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-faithful-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"916ea8724331b0a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-certified-proof","status":"resolved","id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-certified-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnc